{
    "title": "Manticore - Outlaws",
    "kind": "quest",
    "startsWhen": "quest(manticore_ledger) == 2",
    "steps": [
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 4
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "MANTICORE",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "Chapter 8 - Outlaws",
                "zh": "第八章 - 通缉"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Crane moved first. Nova just declared the Manticore a pirate vessel, and put a bounty on every one of us.",
                        "zh": "克莱恩先动手了。新星刚刚宣布蝎尾狮号是海盗船，还给我们每个人都悬了赏。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Of course he did. And now every bounty hunter in Trim wants a piece of us. Their first wave is already at Phoenix Station, hitting Martha's people.",
                        "zh": "他当然会这么做。现在特里姆所有的赏金猎人都想分一杯羹。他们的第一波已经到了凤凰空间站，正在攻击玛莎的人。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Phoenix stood by us at the Maw. We stand by them now. Go.",
                        "zh": "在巨口要塞，凤凰站在我们这边。现在轮到我们帮他们了。去吧。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "outlaws_briefed"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "dock": false,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Defend Phoenix Station from the bounty hunters.",
                "zh": "保卫凤凰空间站，抵挡赏金猎人。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 8
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 5,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 2,
            "behaviour": "friendly",
            "name": "Phoenix Militia"
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Martha Penbury",
            "text": {
                "en": "Manticore! About time. They're everywhere. Watch the big ones, they hit hard.",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号！总算来了。到处都是他们。小心那几艘大的，火力很猛。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Bounty Hunter",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 22,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                },
                {
                    "ship": 23,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Drive off the bounty hunters.",
                "zh": "击退赏金猎人。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Martha Penbury",
            "text": {
                "en": "More coming, Nova colours this time. Crane sent his own ships!",
                "zh": "又来了，这次是新星的涂装。克莱恩派出了自己的船！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Nova Strike Wing",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 5,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                },
                {
                    "ship": 28,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Destroy the Nova strike wing.",
                "zh": "消灭新星突击联队。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "on": false
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Martha Penbury",
            "text": {
                "en": "Phoenix is clear. And Manticore... we've recorded every Nova ship that fired on a civilian station. Add it to your ledger.",
                "zh": "凤凰安全了。还有，蝎尾狮号……我们记录了每一艘向民用空间站开火的新星飞船。把它们也加进你的账本吧。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "reward",
            "credits": 20000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Phoenix defended",
                "zh": "凤凰守住了"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "phoenix_held"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:manticore",
            "dock": true,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Return to the Manticore.",
                "zh": "返回蝎尾狮号。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Ines Marlowe",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Crane is chairing Paragon's board meeting at the Spire in two days. Every director in the sector will be listening.",
                        "zh": "两天后，克莱恩会在尖塔主持典范集团的董事会。星区里所有的董事都会在场听着。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "If someone got close enough to the Spire's relay, I could push the ledger onto every screen in that room.",
                        "zh": "要是有人能靠近尖塔的中继站，我就能把账本推送到那间会议室的每一块屏幕上。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Right into the lion's den. Fine. It's the only way to end this. Ace, get ready for the Spire.",
                        "zh": "直闯狮子窝。好吧，这是了结此事的唯一办法。王牌，准备去尖塔。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "complete",
            "reward": 10000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Chapter 8 complete",
                "zh": "第八章 完成"
            }
        }
    ]
}
